  "agent": {
    "summary": {
      "zh-CN": "平板终端：Linux 平板全屏显示刺激素材，并采集摄像头视频、麦克风音轨和触摸；可查平板现状、实验的平板方案、每条记录的平板采集（时间、屏幕记录、触摸帧数）",
      "en": "Tablet kiosk: a tablet shows stimulus media and records camera video, microphone tracks and touches; its state now, each experiment's plan and each record's tablet captures"
    },
    "skills": "agent/skills"
  }
